<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <title>Split Sheet Studio Blog | Music Rights and Split Sheets</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Practical guidance on music split sheets, publishing administration, producer workflow, master ownership, and sync licensing readiness.">
  <link rel="canonical" href="https://splitsheetstudio.com/blog"><meta name="theme-color" content="#171311">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/style.css"><link rel="stylesheet" href="/premium.css">
</head>
<body class="premium-site"><div class="premium-shell">
  <%- include('partials/site-nav') %>
  <main class="journal-page premium-container">
    <section class="journal-hero"><div class="section-kicker">Blog</div><h1>Clearer rights.<br><span>Cleaner releases.</span></h1><p>Practical notes for artists, producers, songwriters, managers, and independent teams building music together.</p></section>
    <section class="journal-grid"><% posts.forEach((post, index) => { %><article class="journal-card <%= index === 0 ? 'journal-featured' : '' %>"><div class="journal-index">0<%= index + 1 %></div><div class="pill"><%= post.category %></div><h2><a href="/blog/<%= post.slug %>"><%= post.title %></a></h2><p><%= post.excerpt %></p><div class="journal-meta"><span><%= post.publishedAt %></span><span><%= post.readingMinutes %> min read</span></div><a class="text-link" href="/blog/<%= post.slug %>">Read article →</a></article><% }) %></section>
    <section class="journal-cta"><div><h2>Make the agreement part of the session.</h2><p>Use the hosted workflow or capture the split inside Studio One.</p></div><a class="premium-button premium-button-primary" href="<%= signupUrl %>">Create account →</a></section>
  </main>
  <%- include('partials/site-footer') %>
</div></body></html>
